340","text":"肉、魚料理だったらわりと何にでも使えそう ＞ローズマリー\nあとはブイヨンベースのスープに入れてもいいかもですね","ts":"1634364764.161500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=yD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9c18e74f-24fd-4796-855a-bbb41e5473a0","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"普段あまりrosemaryつかってこなかったのであまり知見がない...","ts":"1634364699.160200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UM5p"}]},{"client_msg_id":"69516481-8b07-4be7-ab84-a05c37af0276","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"残念な性格してるのでいつも残さず食べて爆発する","ts":"1634364697.160000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"boom","count":3,"users":["U03C4RC8X","U01HFNMNB55","U01BY3SDBRS"]},{"name":"me-too","count":1,"users":["U76GA7MFA"]},{"name":"lambdalisue_bomb","count":1,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xfWZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4ba808f3-1afd-424c-bcf1-a41de078e0e4","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"rosemaryほかにも使っていきたいのでなにかおすすめの使い方とかみなさまありますか","ts":"1634364684.159100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"v4Or"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d119875e-9525-402e-b9a0-739021e9c9eb","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"そういやこないだroast turkeyつくるときにrosemaryかったんですが","ts":"1634364675.158500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZoSI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"54d27ba5-5dee-46c8-a751-b56e488fd477","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"作りたてを残さず食べてしまいたくなる誘惑が","ts":"1634364664.158100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"u6709","count":1,"users":["U03C4RC8X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"S9c3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"084b447e-ec86-4fdb-a5d9-65fd370c1419","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"技巧派","ts":"1634364641.157600",